==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 2~8 seconds<sup>60f~240f</sup>.
*100 [[Snache]]s spawn after 10.67 seconds<sup>320f</sup>, delay 13.33~40 seconds<sup>400f~1,200f</sup>.
*4 [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**200 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
**10 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~4 seconds<sup>2f~120f</sup>.
**1 [[Mooth]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

